    {
      "source": "Begin creating a <code>SELECT</code> operation for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>domainType</code></a>创建<code>SELECT</code>操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The starting domainType is used for mapping the <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> provided via <code>matching</code>. By default,\nthe originating domainType is also used for mapping back the result from the <code>Row</code>.\nHowever, it is possible to define a different returnType via <code>as</code> to mapping the result.",
      "translation": "起始的 `domainType` 用于通过 `matching` 提供的 `<a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>` 进行映射。默认情况下，也使用源 `domainType` 将结果从 `<code>Row</code>` 映射回来。但是，可以通过 `as` 定义不同的 `returnType` 来映射结果。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, the table to operate on is derived from the initial domainType and can be defined there via\nthe <a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a> annotation. Using <code>inTable</code> allows to\noverride the table name for the execution.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，要操作的表是从初始的 domainType 派生的，并可以通过<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的注解接口\"><code>Table</code></a>注解在此定义。使用<code>inTable</code>可以覆盖执行时的表名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"ReactiveSelectOperation.ReactiveSelect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>ReactiveSelectOperation.ReactiveSelect</code></a> interface provides methods for constructing <code>SELECT</code> operations in a fluent way.",
      "translation": "`ReactiveSelectOperation.ReactiveSelect` 接口提供了以流式方式构建 `SELECT` 操作的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Define a <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> used as the filter for the <code>SELECT</code>.",
      "translation": "定义一个用作 <code>SELECT</code> 过滤条件的<a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Trigger <code>SELECT</code> execution by calling one of the terminating methods.",
      "translation": "通过调用终止方法之一来触发 `<code>SELECT</code>` 的执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Result type override (optional).",
      "translation": "结果类型覆盖（可选）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Table override (optional).",
      "translation": "表覆盖（可选）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"select(java.lang.Class)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of the application domain object.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"select(java.lang.Class)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 应用程序域对象的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>类型</code></a>。</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a> is null.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>domainType</code></a> 为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>domainType</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of the domain object to query; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>domainType</code> - 要查询的域对象的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "new instance of <a href=\"ReactiveSelectOperation.ReactiveSelect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>ReactiveSelectOperation.ReactiveSelect</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"ReactiveSelectOperation.ReactiveSelect.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveSelectOperation.ReactiveSelect</code></a>实例。",
